<BaseLayout
  title="On-Policy Self-Distillation: When the Model Teaches Itself | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="OPSD lets a single LLM act as both teacher and student simultaneously — the teacher sees the answer, the student only sees the question, and both share the same weights. Dense token-level supervision with no external teacher and no distribution mismatch."
  crumb="OPSD"
>

